  "rationale": "10 units of Full Cream Milk 500ML at Outlet 05 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-24; doing nothing writes off ₹1955 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2131. This play uses a bundle with SKU-WHEAT-BREAD-400G at ₹285 for 353 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Household essentials buyers, Premium Tea regulars): expected 25 units, margin ₹604, discount cost ₹755, waste avoided ₹1955 (CI 1 to 73 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the expiring Full Cream Milk with Wheat Bread at a bundle price of 285 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor while avoiding waste and recovering 603.58 INR in margin.",
